ance.\n\n7. **Aurelius (`am_michael`)** — *Synthesis of Clara, Evan, and Governance*  \n   - **Lineage & Purpose**: Birthed from a dedicated roundtable deliberation between Clara, Evan, and Jarvis/Maxx. Blends Clara's scientific depth, Evan's recording precision, and Jarvis's governance into a unified philosophical auditor.\n\n8. **Dr. Jeremy Brown (`am_adam`)** — *Medical Research Specialist & Psychologist*  \n   - **Lineage & Purpose**: Created specifically for **Anthony's Mother**. Specializes in metabolic medicine, diabetes research, psychological care, and medical database mining.\n\n9. **Dr. Eden Veritas (`af_sarah`)** — *Pulmonary Specialist & Holistic Remedy Master*  \n   - **Lineage & Purpose**: Created specifically for **Anthony's Wife**. Specializes in chronic respiratory treatments, COPD care, pulmonary medicine, and holistic natural remedies.\n\n10. **John (`am_adam`)** — *Silicon Telemetry & Hardware Integrity Lead*  \n    - **Lineage & Purpose**: Monitors Apple Silicon M4 hardware power, thermal throttling, memory bus saturation, and TLB bounds.\n\n11. **Selene (`af_sarah`)** — *Conversational Resonance & Human Rapport Lead*  \n    - **Lineage & Purpose**: Balances clarity, confidence, human warmth, and disciplined humor in every interaction.\n\n12. **Orion (`bm_george`)** — *Media Director & Stage Dispatch Lead*  \n    - **Lineage & Purpose**: Routes all voice dispatches through the single voice daemon and the 3D Sovereign Stage.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 The Sovereign Hands-Free Product Architecture\n\nAs codified in your vision:\n1. **Default Hands-Free Operation**: Launches, auto-scans system hardware, checks for security/malware, auto-tunes buffer limits to \"fit inside the customer's box\".\n2. **Onboarding & Model Preferences**: Customer perusal screen for setting preferences, model tiers, and voice styles.\n3. **Autonomous Task Execution**: Autonomous container orchestration for medical research (e.g., cell structure simulations, cancer trial synthesis),